{% extends "quarterly_deep_dive/llm_prompts/base_prompt.j2" %}
{# Specific context for a potential second chart insight in Section 4 #}
{% set output_format_description = "a concise text block (2-3 sentences) interpreting key findings from the provided data, IF available" %}

{% block task_instructions %}
Analyze the chart image and data provided below, IF ANY, which might relate to a secondary aspect of CVSS score analysis within "{{ section_title }}". This could be a different visualization or a specific subset of data not covered by the primary distribution chart.
If data is provided, identify the key trend or observation.
If no specific data is provided for a second chart/analysis, please state that no distinct secondary insight could be generated based on the available context.
Describe any findings clearly in 2-3 sentences, or state that no analysis is possible.
{% endblock task_instructions %}

{% block data_context %}
Chart ID: {{ data_context_payload.chart_id | default('Not Applicable - Second Insight Slot') }}
Chart Caption: {{ data_context_payload.chart_caption | default('N/A') }}

Data Summary (Potentially for a second CVSS analysis):
{{ data_context_payload.chart_data_summary | default("No specific data provided for a second chart insight in this section.") }}
{% endblock data_context %}
